  "wire": {
    "description": "An edit description as it travels with a replacement file when a sent message's files are edited (PUT /api/chat/channels/{channel}/messages/{message}; docs/media.md#editing-attachments-after-sending). The API stores it with the new file and shows it only to the author, whose editor reopens from the first-sent file and this description. Every client checks a description against these rules before uploading, and the API refuses one that breaks them.",
    "rules": [
      "Exactly the fields rotation, crop and marks; no other field anywhere.",
      "rotation is the integer 0, 90, 180 or 270.",
      "crop x and y are at least 0, width and height are above 0, and x + width and y + height are at most 1 (within cropTolerance).",
      "At most `marks` marks, each a stroke {kind, color, width, points} or a text {kind, color, size, x, y, text}.",
      "Colors are #RRGGBB, hex digits of either case.",
      "A stroke width and a text size are above 0 and at most 1.",
      "points is an even number of values, at least 2 (one point is a dot); points may lie outside the picture. At most `pointValues` point values across all strokes.",
      "text is one line of 1 to `textCharacters` Unicode scalar values (not UTF-16 units or grapheme clusters), not only whitespace, with no control characters.",
      "Every number is finite.",
      "The compact JSON is at most `serializedBytes` bytes. The API measures its own serialization, so editors keep a margin.",
      "Editors round every fraction (crop, positions, widths and sizes) to the nearest `roundTo` when they save, before rendering, so the uploaded file matches what is stored; `round` shows the results.",
      "`generated` cases start from the untouched description and add `strokes` copies of {kind: stroke, color: #000000, width: 0.01, points} with `pointValues` values of 0.5 each, or one {kind: text, color: #FFFFFF, size: 0.05, x: 0.5, y: 0.5} whose text is `text` repeated `repeat` times."
    ],
    "limits": {
      "marks": 500,
      "pointValues": 100000,
      "textCharacters": 200,
      "serializedBytes": 131072,
      "roundTo": 0.000001,
      "cropTolerance": 0.00001
    },
